ansplant recipients in the patient\'s medical record?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1556,'DOC-21','Q_55','mdg_14.4','Preoperative evaluation of vascular anatomy of potential donor','Is there documentation of a preoperative evaluation of vascular anatomy for a potential donor in the context of renal transplant evaluation?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1557,'DOC-21','Q_56','mdg_15','Renal vein thrombosis, suspected','Is there documentation in the medical record indicating a suspicion of renal vein thrombosis?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1558,'DOC-21','Q_57','mdg_16.1','Duplex ultrasonography results indeterminate (eg, due to bowel gas or obesity)','Is there documentation in the medical record of indeterminate duplex ultrasonography results due to bowel gas or obesity in a patient with suspected renovascular hypertension?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1559,'DOC-21','Q_58','mdg_16.2','Patient is candidate for surgical or endovascular intervention.','Is there evidence in the medical record that the patient is a candidate for surgical or endovascular intervention due to suspected renovascular hypertension?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1560,'DOC-21','Q_59','mdg_16.3','Strong clinical suspicion of renovascular hypertension (eg, renal bruit, resistant hypertension, known fibromuscular dysplasia, sudden onset of severe hypertension, onset of hypertension in patient younger than 30 years, sudden unexplained pulmonary edema)','Is there strong clinical suspicion of renovascular hypertension, such as renal bruit, resistant hypertension, known fibromuscular dysplasia, sudden onset of severe hypertension, onset of hypertension in a patient younger than 30 years, or sudden unexplained pulmonary edema, documented in the patient\'s medical record?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1561,'DOC-21','Q_60','mdg_17','Retroperitoneal bleed, suspected','Is there documentation in the medical record indicating a suspected retroperitoneal bleed?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1562,'DOC-21','Q_61','mdg_18','Splenic artery aneurysm or pseudoaneurysm evaluation needed','Is there documentation in the medical record indicating the need for evaluation of a splenic artery aneurysm or pseudoaneurysm?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1563,'DOC-21','Q_62','mdg_19','Trauma of abdomen or pelvis, known or suspected','Is there documentation in the medical record of trauma to the abdomen or pelvis, known or suspected?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1564,'DOC-21','Q_63','mdg_20','Vascular graft complication, suspected (eg, infection, thrombosis, pseudoaneurysm)','Is there evidence in the medical record of a suspected vascular graft complication, such as infection, thrombosis, or pseudoaneurysm?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1565,'DOC-21','Q_64','mdg_21.2','Prior imaging results of specific area or structure with same imaging modality documented and available for comparison','Are prior imaging results of the abdominal or pelvic area with the same imaging modality documented and available for comparison?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1566,'DOC-21','Q_65','mdg_21.1.1','Change in clinical status (eg, worsening symptoms or new associated symptoms), and findings may impact treatment','Is there documentation of a change in clinical status, such as worsening symptoms or new associated symptoms, that may impact treatment in the patient\'s medical record?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1567,'DOC-21','Q_66','mdg_21.1.2','Need for interval reassessment that may impact treatment plan','Is there a documented need for interval reassessment that may impact the treatment plan, specifically for repeat evaluation of a specific area or structure with the same imaging modality?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08'),(1568,'DOC-21','Q_67','mdg_21.1.3','Need for re-imaging either prior to or after performance of invasive procedure','Is there a clinical need for re-imaging either prior to or after the performance of an invasive procedure, specifically for repeat evaluation of a specific area or structure with the same imaging modality?','regular','Explicit','indication','2025-09-26 11:44:09','2025-09-26 11:44:08','2025-09-26 11:44:08');
